---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import OptInRibbon from '../components/OptInRibbon.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The System - Complete Blog Sales Training"
  description="The complete training program for writing blog posts that rank on Google and convert readers into customers. Join the waitlist for early access."
>
  <OptInRibbon
    headline="Founding member pricing available for a limited time."
    ctaText="Join Waitlist"
    ctaHref="#waitlist"
  />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container-narrow text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 mb-6 text-sm font-medium bg-accent/10 text-accent-dark rounded-full">
        Coming Soon
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 mb-6">
        The System
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-600 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        The complete training for writing blog posts that rank on Google <em>and</em> convert readers into paying customers.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problem -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 mb-8 text-center">
        You've Been Lied To About Content Marketing
      </h2>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p>
          They told you to "create valuable content" and the traffic would come. They told you to "be consistent" and eventually you'd build an audience.
        </p>
        <p>
          So you wrote. And wrote. And wrote some more.
        </p>
        <p>
          You published "ultimate guides" and "how-to" posts. You optimized for keywords. You promoted on social media. You did everything the gurus said.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>And yet...</strong>
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your posts get buried on page 2 of Google</li>
          <li>The traffic you do get bounces without converting</li>
          <li>You're creating content that attracts tire-kickers, not buyers</li>
          <li>Your competitors are somehow getting results with less content</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          The truth? <strong>Most "content marketing" advice is designed for media companies, not businesses that need to sell.</strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          You don't need more pageviews. You need more customers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Promise -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 mb-8 text-center">
        There's a Better Way
      </h2>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p>
          What if every blog post you wrote was engineered to:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Rank for keywords that signal buying intent</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Keep readers engaged from first sentence to final CTA</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Pre-sell your solution before they even see your offer</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Convert at 2-5x the rate of normal content</strong></li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          That's what happens when you apply direct-response copywriting principles to blog content.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>The System</strong> shows you exactly how to do it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's Inside -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 mb-12 text-center">
        What's Inside
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Module 1: The Foundation</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Understand why most content fails and the direct-response principles that make content convert. This mindset shift changes everything.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Module 2: Keyword Selection</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Learn to identify keywords that signal buying intent, not just search volume. Target the searches that lead to sales.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Module 3: The Templates</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Get plug-and-play templates for every type of converting blog post. Problem-Agitate-Solution, Comparison Posts, Ultimate Guides, and Case Studies.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Module 4: Headlines & Hooks</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Master the art of opening lines that grab attention and keep readers scrolling. The first 100 words determine if your post converts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Module 5: The Body Copy</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Structure your posts for maximum persuasion while satisfying search intent. Handle objections, build desire, and move readers toward action.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Module 6: CTAs That Convert</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Learn where to place calls to action, how to write them, and how to make them irresistible without being pushy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Module 7: The Publishing System</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">A sustainable workflow for consistently producing high-converting content. Quality over quantity, systematized.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who It's For -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 mb-8 text-center">
        Who This Is For
      </h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 bg-green-50 rounded-xl">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            This IS For You If:
          </h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>You're a freelancer or consultant who wants inbound leads</li>
            <li>You sell courses, services, or high-ticket offers</li>
            <li>You understand that content should generate revenue</li>
            <li>You're willing to write less but write better</li>
            <li>You have something worth selling</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-red-50 rounded-xl">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            This is NOT For You If:
          </h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>You want quick traffic hacks</li>
            <li>You're not willing to learn direct-response principles</li>
            <li>You just want "brand awareness"</li>
            <li>You don't have a clear offer to sell</li>
            <li>You're looking for AI to write everything for you</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Waitlist CTA -->
  <section id="waitlist" class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-primary-900 text-white">
    <div class="container-narrow text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">
        Join the Waitlist
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        The System is coming soon. Join the waitlist to get founding member pricing and early access.
      </p>
      <div class="max-w-md mx-auto">
        <a href="/free-training" class="btn-accent text-lg w-full block">
          Get Free Training + Join Waitlist
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-4">
          Start with the free training. You'll be added to the waitlist automatically.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 mb-12 text-center">
        Questions
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
            When will The System be available?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">
            We're targeting launch within the next few months. Join the waitlist via the free training to be notified first and get founding member pricing.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
            What's the price?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">
            Founding members will get a significant discount off the full price. Final pricing will be announced to the waitlist first.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
            Is there a guarantee?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">
            Yes. Details will be announced at launch, but we stand behind the system. If it doesn't work for you, we'll make it right.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
